    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1728540081458\" id=\"item-67076db1a6a1cb7490ccd8c2\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-video video-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/34418.js&quot;,&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.video\" data-sqsp-block=\"video\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1728881134740_2987\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728881134740_2987\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div class=\"intrinsic\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n  <div\n    class=\"sqs-block-video-placeholder sqs-block-video-placeholder--in-progress\"\n    data-animation-role=\"video\"\n    data-block-state=\"uninitialized\"\n  >\n    <div class=\"sqs-block-video-placeholder__ui\">\n      <div class=\"sqs-block-video-placeholder__icon\">\n        <div class=\"loading-indicator\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"25 25 50 50\" class=\"loading-indicator__spinner\">\n            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"14\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" class=\"loading-indicator__path\"></circle>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n    \n\n\n\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728881134740_2987 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728881134740_2987 .intrinsic {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728881134740_2987 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-video-block-blend);\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-video-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728881134740_2987 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728881134740_2987 .intrinsic {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n  <style>#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728881134740_2987 { border-width: 0; height: auto; }</style>\n  \n  \n  \n    <style>\n    \n      \n    \n      \n        @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728881134740_2987 { background-color: transparent; }\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728881134740_2987 .intrinsic { background-color: var(--tweak-video-block-background-color); }\n        }\n      \n    \n    </style>\n  \n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-6869ed8716195efa8d90\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specialises in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floor-plans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Experience the seamless blend of rustic charm and modern living with this delightful A-frame home located at 13 Inverness Crescent in the serene neighborhood of Arrowtown. This unique property offers a captivating retreat with its stylish design and idyllic setting.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Property Highlights:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Location</strong>: 13 Inverness Crescent, Arrowtown, nestled within lush, landscaped gardens offering privacy and tranquility.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Interior Features</strong>: This well-appointed home features 3 cozy bedrooms, a versatile living room that opens to the outdoors, and a bathroom with modern fittings including a laundry area. The interior is characterized by vaulted ceilings, exposed beams, and large windows that fill the space with natural light and offer breathtaking views of the surrounding landscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchen &amp; Dining</strong>: A contemporary kitchen with stainless steel appliances, ample storage, and striking green tile backsplash opens into a spacious dining area, perfect for family gatherings. The dining area flows onto a wooden deck, ideal for alfresco dining and entertaining.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor &amp; Gardens</strong>: The property boasts a charming exterior with a spacious garden and mature trees, providing a picturesque outdoor living space. The home\u2019s striking A-frame design complements its natural surroundings, making it a perfect haven for nature lovers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ideal for families or as a holiday retreat, this property promises comfort and style in one of Arrowtown's most sought-after locations. Enjoy peaceful living with easy access to local amenities and outdoor activities in a home that beautifully integrates indoor and outdoor living.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">For further information and to schedule a viewing, please contact our real estate office.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspect-ratio&quot;:&quot;square&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;67091207c3878e14d17d290c&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;lightbox&quot;:false,&quot;padding&quot;:20,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;thumbnails-per-row&quot;:4,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;67091207c3878e14d17d290c&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728538267178_58788\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"670912083e2c656eb9589abb\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1728647823044-BBTWI3QBD01R07HH7XIL/13+Inverness+Cres+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%284%29.jpg\" alt=\"13 Inverness Cres Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (4).jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"